  "components": [],
  "timeoriginalestimate": null,
  "description": {
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1,
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Description"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The Inventory Value report values stock as of a date you choose. Whatever date is chosen, it answers with the day after it \u2014 always exactly one day out."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Steps to reproduce"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Environment: QA branch sv8582 (https://sv8582.qa.shopview.com). Desktop browser, signed in as an Admin."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "orderedList",
     "attrs": {
      "order": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open Reports, then Inventory Value."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Set a custom date range ending 3 August 2026 and press Apply."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Read the \"As of\" line just under the report title. It reads 08/04/2026, not the 3 August that was asked for."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Set a range ending 31 July 2026 and press Apply. The \"As of\" line reads 08/01/2026."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Set a range ending 31 January 2026 and press Apply. The \"As of\" line reads 02/01/2026."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Current behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The report values stock one day later than the date asked for, every time. The stored history is genuinely being read \u2014 a 31 July request returns a different total from today's \u2014 so it is reading the wrong day rather than falling back to today."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Asking for a date years before any stock history exists still comes back one day late, so the shift is arithmetic on the date asked for."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "For the developer: the resolved date comes back as as_of_date on the Inventory Value report response."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "mediaSingle",
     "attrs": {
      "layout": "align-start"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "media",
       "attrs": {
        "type": "file",
        "id": "22fd1dc5-c4f8-410b-998a-ec8c2dfcc60b",
        "alt": "image-20260804-063045.png",
        "collection": ""
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "A range ending 3 August 2026, with the \"As of\" line reading 08/04/2026."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "mediaSingle",
     "attrs": {
      "layout": "align-start"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "media",
       "attrs": {
        "type": "file",
        "id": "80bf7126-7184-44b7-8a0c-1f269f4f8f16",
        "alt": "image-20260804-063240.png",
        "collection": ""
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "A range ending 31 July 2026, with the \"As of\" line reading 08/01/2026."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Expected behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The report values stock as of the last day of the range asked for. If no stock was recorded on that exact day, it falls back to the nearest recorded day on or before it \u2014 never after it."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "rule"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Source",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " \u2014 "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "the "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Inventory Value report specification",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "link",
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020aa00b8d6a71f4259891982a304227c20/pages/720142338/Inventory+Value+Report"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " on Confluence, version 4, requirement S5-R2: \u201cThe report values inventory as of the end of the selected range.\u201d"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The same description, requirement S5-R4: \u201cOtherwise, the report replays the closest recorded day on or before the end of the selected range.\u201d"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The same description, requirement S5-R7: \u201cA Custom range lets the user pick a start and end date; the report values as of the picked end date (never a future date \u2014 it is capped at today).\u201d"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
